      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.04,
          "end": 3.57,
          "en": "Whilst merging this code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.57,
          "end": 7.08,
          "en": "and outputting the final code base worked fine here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.08,
          "end": 11.31,
          "en": "you will sometimes face an error when ChatGPT",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.31,
          "end": 15.3,
          "en": "tries to output very long code snippets,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.3,
          "end": 18.78,
          "en": "where it then basically runs out of characters",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.78,
          "end": 23.22,
          "en": "in its response because these ChatGPT responses can be big,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 23.22,
          "end": 26.79,
          "en": "but they can't contain an endless amount of characters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 26.79,
          "end": 30.81,
          "en": "And therefore sometimes you might face this problem",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 30.81,
          "end": 35.81,
          "en": "where ChatGPT all of a sudden stops outputting code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 35.97,
          "end": 39.69,
          "en": "Now in such cases, you can of course type continue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 39.69,
          "end": 41.403,
          "en": "to basically tell ChatGPT",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 41.403,
          "end": 43.77,
          "en": "that it should continue outputting code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 43.77,
          "end": 46.14,
          "en": "but often you'll then face the problem",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 46.14,
          "end": 48.72,
          "en": "that the code is now not formatted,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 48.72,
          "end": 50.7,
          "en": "and instead the regular text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 50.7,
          "end": 53.22,
          "en": "starts getting formatted as code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 53.22,
          "end": 56.34,
          "en": "And this error occurs because ChatGPT",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.34,
          "end": 58.98,
          "en": "closed the code block here in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.98,
          "end": 60.81,
          "en": "but doesn't reopen it here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60.81,
          "end": 64.11,
          "en": "because it doesn't understand that it was interrupted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.11,
          "end": 67.353,
          "en": "and didn't properly finish outputting code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.37,
          "end": 70.11,
          "en": "Now to work around this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.11,
          "end": 74.7,
          "en": "it sometimes works to alter this prompt a little bit,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 74.7,
          "end": 78.037,
          "en": "and instead of just saying continue, you could say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 78.037,
          "end": 82.23,
          "en": "\"Output continuing as text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 82.23,
          "end": 87.23,
          "en": "and then continue with the remaining code,\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 88.59,
          "end": 90.57,
          "en": "or something like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 90.57,
          "end": 93.57,
          "en": "If you send this prompt to ChatGPT,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 93.57,
          "end": 96.9,
          "en": "it basically does not start with the code right away again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 96.9,
          "end": 98.88,
          "en": "but instead with some plain text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 98.88,
          "end": 101.34,
          "en": "And when it then does start with the code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 101.34,
          "end": 103.5,
          "en": "it opens the formatting again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 103.5,
          "end": 105.63,
          "en": "However, here in my case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.63,
          "end": 108.87,
          "en": "it actually started outputting the entire code again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 108.87,
          "end": 111.21000000000001,
          "en": "which is, of course, not what I want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 111.21000000000001,
          "end": 113.55,
          "en": "And therefore, here I'll stop generating,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 113.55,
          "end": 117.93,
